      "updated": 1761264000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Golden rule: a resource is complete only when all six locations agree. The schema is the data source of truth; apps/api/openapi.yaml is the HTTP source of truth;\npackages/api-contracts/types/index.ts is generated from it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Golden rule: a resource is complete only when all six locations agree. The schema is the data source of truth; apps/api/openapi.yaml is the HTTP source of truth;\npackages/api-contracts/types/index.ts is generated from it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "label-88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 872,
      "width": 1460,
      "height": 16.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5f646b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 276,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 277,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761264000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The dashboard never calls fetch directly for CRUD. It goes through Modules → generated Resource → typed client → ApiClient → NestJS controller.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The dashboard never calls fetch directly for CRUD. It goes through Modules → generated Resource → typed client → ApiClient → NestJS controller.",
